<title>GREECE: Greek WPI inflation falls to 6.1 pct yr/yr in Oct.</title>
<headline>Greek WPI inflation falls to 6.1 pct yr/yr in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's wholesale price inflation (WPI) dropped to 6.1 percent year-on-year in October from 6.4 percent in September, the National Statistics Service (NSS) said in a statement.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICE INDEX   Oct 96   Sept 96   Oct 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month (pct)	0.6	--	  0.9</p>
<p>    Year-on-year   (pct)	6.1	6.4	 6.4</p>
<p>    index (1980=100)	  865.2     860.0     815.4</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
